              <object class="AdwSwitchRow" id="verified_mls_groups_row">
                <property name="title" translatable="yes">Only join groups where every member's app proves their account</property>
                <property name="subtitle" translatable="yes">Refuses people whose app can't prove their account, like older White Noise or Amethyst, even if Groundhog verified them another way. If an admin adds one to a group you're in, you can't read its new messages.</property>
