                <property name="title" translatable="yes">Let people using older Marmot apps invite me</property>
                <property name="subtitle" translatable="yes">Also publishes an older-format invitation key for older White Noise and Amethyst. Anyone can link the two keys to your account. Off: that key is withdrawn.</property>
